 # tags: rfd:hook
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2468) 'Today an i32 value is folded away on the host whenever the compiler already knows it, and
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2468) 'refused the moment it is computed at run time: an argument, or anything derived from one.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

