2026-11-07T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2468) 'Hold run-time i32 values as i32 tensors on the device, and add element-wise kernels under XLA's
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2468) 'wrapping semantics: add, subtract, multiply, compare, select, clamp, and convert to and from
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2468) 'f32. Lift each refusal that exists only for lack of one of these kernels, case by case, so that
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2468) 'every case in the generator is either bit-equal on the GPU or carries a measured reason in
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2468) 'XFAIL, with all 11 desk gates kept green throughout.
