2026-11-07T00:00:29Z (RFD66606-2468) '- Run-time i32 values held as i32 tensors on the device, never folded away because they were
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:30Z (RFD66606-2468) '  not known at compile time.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:31Z (RFD66606-2468) '- Element-wise kernels: add, subtract, multiply, compare, select, clamp, and conversion to and
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-11-07T00:00:32Z (RFD66606-2468) '  from f32, each under XLA's own wrapping semantics rather than a saturating one.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2468  1 LINE
 Text:Written

